    "No direct query-specific CNS exposure data are available.",
    "Most positive evidence comes from inflamed meninges, so healthy-BBB access is less certain.",
    "The highest-similarity molecule, cefpodoxime, showed low CSF penetration, introducing uncertainty."
  ],
